WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.407
This example brings several ideas together in one small report.

00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:11.477
We start with six daily sales values and three counters: low, target, and high.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:17.527
Each sale is checked. Values below one thousand increase the low counter.

00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:21.512
Values up to eighteen hundred increase the target counter.

00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:24.364
Anything larger increases the high counter.

00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:31.624
For the current data, expect two low days, three target days, and one high day.

00:00:31.624 --> 00:00:40.874
Notice the pattern: initialize counters, loop through the values, classify each one, and update the correct counter.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.100
This is a very reusable analytics structure.
